# Build context for the PRODUCTION image. BuildKit picks this up automatically
# because it is named <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore.
#
# Unlike the dev .dockerignore, this one deliberately LETS THE RESULTS THROUGH --
# a hosted container has no bind mount, so generated-by-pheweb/ must be baked in.
# What it excludes is everything the *server* never opens.
#
# Note the `**/` prefixes: without them a pattern matches only at the context
# root, which is the bug that made the dev image 32 GB.

# --- never ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.venv
pheweb_env/
.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
slurm_outs/

# --- load inputs: needed to BUILD the results, not to serve them ---------------
# ~7 GB of normalized .norm.csv.gz plus the raw .txt sumstats.
**/data/
**/*.mlma

# --- load-time intermediates inside generated-by-pheweb/ -----------------------
**/generated-by-pheweb/parsed/
**/generated-by-pheweb/tmp/
**/generated-by-pheweb/sites/sites.tsv
**/generated-by-pheweb/sites/sites-rsids.tsv
**/generated-by-pheweb/sites/sites-unannotated.tsv
# (sites/cpras-rsids.sqlite3 IS kept -- it backs variant autocomplete)

# --- reference genome: only normalize_sumstats.py needs it, and that runs before
#     the image is built ---------------------------------------------------------
**/*.fa
**/*.fai

# --- superseded / backup files -------------------------------------------------
**/*.bak
**/*.bak2
**/*.round3-5e8
**/pheno-list.json.bak*
**/UU_CFAM_GSD_1.0_rosy.refseq.ensformat.bed
**/UU_Cfam_GSD_1.0_ROSY.refSeq.ensformat.genes.validchr.bed

# --- other datasets: this image serves one -------------------------------------
example_cat_datadir/
example_dog_datadir/

# --- docs and dev tooling: not needed at runtime -------------------------------
docs/
*.md
!README.md
